~ start
if DataManager.get_flag("got_quest") == true && QuestManager.active_quest.quest_progression != 5:
	=> quest_got

if QuestManager.active_quest.quest_progression == 5:
	[$> QuestManager.update_quest()]
	=> quest_completed

Danny: Welcome to the FRESH testing grounds! This is a [shake]HEAVY[/shake] work in progress, so expect this place to become pretty later.
Danny: There are some things I think you should test out, starting with combat. [if QuestManager.get_active_quest_current_step() == 0][$> QuestManager.update_quest()][/if][$> DataManager.set_flag("got_quest", true)]
Danny: You can find the portals by heading outside and pressing SPACE to scan for them!
Danny: Happy testing :)/
=> END

~ quest_got
Danny: You already got my quest!
=> END

~ quest_completed
Danny: Thank you for playing this ship :D
Danny: Let me (the creator) know what you think!
Danny: You can quit the game now haha, press ESC after this dialogue is over.

=> END